{"name": "Chess Tales", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chess Reimagined: not as a board, but as a journey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through a living labyrinth of puzzles, defended by Queens, Rooks, Knights and Bishops. The same familiar chess movements used in completely new and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/50feff6c2297e04b2e1feb07b63107a4.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/50feff6c2297e04b2e1feb07b63107a4.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/50feff6c2297e04b2e1feb07b63107a4.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>From Gardens to Waters to Cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey takes you through overgrown gardens, ruins, portals, flooded paths, collapsing caves, dangerous dungeons, and finally into the castle itself. Each area transforms familiar chess movement into something new, forcing you to think beyond the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/6b65437279f349c8899c2bb4e3cee294.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/6b65437279f349c8899c2bb4e3cee294.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/6b65437279f349c8899c2bb4e3cee294.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolving Gameplay Across Terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate  forests, go through portals, sneak past sleeping guards, avoid explosive tiles and entangling vines, and survive collapsing squares that punish careless moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/c1076b062ad826c356c1968e2f2f655e.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/c1076b062ad826c356c1968e2f2f655e.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/c1076b062ad826c356c1968e2f2f655e.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Twist the Rules of Chess</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic chess movement meets unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teleport through <strong>portals</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"308\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/97e88eafce9b9f96f5733845cc37a887.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"954\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/97e88eafce9b9f96f5733845cc37a887.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/97e88eafce9b9f96f5733845cc37a887.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and blast enemy pieces with <strong>bombs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/17be1f2301abb69ecad71485cc37f55d.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"646\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/17be1f2301abb69ecad71485cc37f55d.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/17be1f2301abb69ecad71485cc37f55d.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And that\u2019s just the start - from shifting tiles to unpredictable environmental interactions, each level builds on what you\u2019ve learned and keeps you thinking in new ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan Ahead, Outsmart the Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies patrol in predictable, cyclical patterns, allowing those who think ahead to turn danger into opportunity. Learn each enemy\u2019s unique routes to outsmart them and break through their defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/4cd0e6989954138dad9e2a85066910cb.poster.avif?t=1779357581\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/4cd0e6989954138dad9e2a85066910cb.webm?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/extras/4cd0e6989954138dad9e2a85066910cb.mp4?t=1779357581\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Checkmate: Face the King</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of your journey lies the Throne Room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the King in a final, decisive battle in multiple phases and shatter his rule once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a game of chess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Lead your chess army beyond the 8x8 board into a heavily guarded, enchanted fortress, solving environmental puzzles across dilapidated ruins, portals, overgrown gardens, collapsing caves, cities and trap-filled dungeons until you reach the throne and face the King.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297910/2d905012403c41152536dc58d1f0a500679f5ef0/header.jpg?t=1779357581", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Casual", "Puzzle", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Stylized", "Tabletop"], "developers": "IRG Studios", "publishers": "IRG Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4297910", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/W8vI_Ft7c1k", "first_seen": 1779235200.0}